                                                "example_id": "d00a42a0-771c-450f-ab93-48df62c4e588",
                                                "sense_id": "258f74c8-85ef-3baf-bf9d-03016b105e24",
                                                "text": "It was damp, it was not free from dry rot, there was a flavour of rats in it, and it was the gloomy victim of that indescribable decay which settles on all the work of man’s hands whenever it’s not turned to man’s account."
